    {
      "id": "3ec1c44b218f",
      "name": "morning-briefing",
      "prompt": "Give the user a morning briefing with:\n\n## 1. Project Health\nDO NOT run pytest, jest, dotnet test, or any test command yourself.\nRead the last entry of ~/.hermes/logs/health/repo-health.jsonl and summarise it verbatim.\nIf the file is missing or empty, report \"no health snapshot yet - waiting for the next repo-health-check interval (every 120m)\".\nFor git status, use plain `git -C <repo> status --short` (no test commands).\n\n## 2. Yesterday \u2014 Self-Improvement Status\nRead the latest files in ~/.hermes/logs/maintenance/ and ~/.hermes/logs/reflection/:\n- **Latest gap-finding** ~/.hermes/logs/maintenance/gap-finding-*.json \u2014 any uncovered domains?\n- **Latest near-miss** ~/.hermes/logs/maintenance/near-miss-*.json \u2014 any untriggered policies?\n- **Yesterday's self-reflection** ~/.hermes/logs/reflection/*.md \u2014 what improvement items were suggested? Were they completed?\n- **Latest meta-improver outcome** ~/.hermes/meta/change-outcomes.jsonl \u2014 how many outcomes determined?\n- **Improvement velocity** ~/.hermes/meta/metrics.jsonl \u2014 what's the domain coverage trend?\n\n## 3. Carry-over from Yesterday\nCheck if yesterday's reflection had improvement items that are still open.\n\n## 4. Active tasks + blockers\nCheck ~/Documents/code/.hermes/OBJECTIVES.md + task queue.\n\nStructured output:\n---\n**Morning Briefing \u2014 [date]**\n\n**Yesterday:**\n- [bullet: project work]\n- [bullet: what the reflection proposed]\n- [bullet: whether those items got done]\n\n**Self-Improvement Health:**\n- Domain coverage: [X]% (change from yesterday: +/-)\n- Untriggered policies: [N]\n- Uncovered domains: [N]\n- Outcome velocity: [N pending, N determined]\n\n**Project Health:**\n- Signal: [pass/fail + count]\n- LUX: [pass/fail]\n- Prospector: [pass/fail + count + .NET count]\n\n**Carry-over from yesterday:** [open improvement items]\n\n**What are today's priorities?**\n---",
